Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gin time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to let you go I'm just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going to meet you? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were crossing yet another desert\Nwhen Kari got sick and collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai kind of freaked out because it\Nseems that when they were younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she almost died, and Tai blames himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We soon discovered a deserted\Ncity, and while Sora and T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watched over Kari, Tai and I\Nwent in search of medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Machinedramon and his goons\Nwere tracking our every move,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and on our way back from the hospital,\Nwe just barely escaped annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:02:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we finally rejoined the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Machinedramon showed up and imploded\Nthe building we were hiding in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could things get any worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.28,0:02:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}Goodbye, Numemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paraba! Numemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long do humans usually\Nsleep when they're sick, TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tough to say for sure, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I guess anywhere between\Neight hours and eight years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give or take a minute or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.82,0:02:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, then considering how high her\Nfever is, we'd better get comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish one of the older kids were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they'd know how to wake her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.74,0:02:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll think of something, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still not sure that woke her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be wrong. Hi, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit the snooze button one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.07,0:02:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've slept enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think my fever's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how long was I asleep for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:02:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just say that when you fell asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had nine lives, and now\NI'm down to only three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I hear Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's found anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that with Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Beemon! And Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, you're awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look so much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Tai and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked everywhere, but\Ncouldn't find them. Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is that when we all fell,\NTai and Izzy landed somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what Biyomon found.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's the medicine\NTai went to find for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you keep it in\Ncase your fever comes back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use it as a reminder\Nof how much Tai loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place has a lot of\Ntwists and turns to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure if we all look together, we'll\Nhave no problem finding the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll work as a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll try to be\Nstrong enough to help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, Tai would do the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is like a museum of the\Nfamous sewer systems of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pass on the other exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, do you guys hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can hear it now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think it could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it sounds like\Nit's coming from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make me sick didn't\Nhave such a weakness to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sunlight We wouldn't\Nhave to keep them working
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,underground to power machine or bond city
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On fire? You deserve to live in sewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get back to work\Nbefore I really get mad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to be so cuddly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not Monzaemon,\NTK. That's WaruMonzaemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monzaemon was sweet and cute, but Waru\NMonzaemon is about as cuddly as a porcupine.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.41,0:05:18.38,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}WaruMonzaemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.41,0:05:18.38,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.41,0:05:18.38,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.41,0:05:18.38,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Puppet Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.41,0:05:18.38,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.41,0:05:18.38,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Heartbreak Attack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His bear claw will give you heartburn\Nalong with his heartbreak attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's torturing those\Npoor Numemon down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can one kind of Puppet Digimon be\Nso nice while another can be so evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been too hard on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.44,0:05:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, break's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had... more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she get sick again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's been sleeping in my bed! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:05:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here they are now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari! Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, please leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.18,0:06:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to free the\NNumemon from their chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch us if you can, you big throw run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, I'm still me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys must be low on energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now, Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running comes to mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bear Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My paw's stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Literally!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for Digi-Distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, something wonderful\Nis happening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been able to\Nfly this fast before!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch me go! Faster! Fast! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you're faster than,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as you're faster than\Na gigantic rolling teddy bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kauri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kauri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Numemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:07:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you Numemon, what\Nare you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it time for your flogging?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there, staring!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to work! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cut your chains off? I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're through!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, you green blomph of sludge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat the stuffing out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Mammon. Oh... Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think you\Nhave a chance against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is easier than swatting Digi-fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that light coming from? Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surging with energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, get me a sprouting post! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Jeroboamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, getting up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put you to work too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to keep them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more chains, Numemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're cute when they're not so slimy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, Queen Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:09:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That light again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My light will guide us towards the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think it's like\Nthis nightlight I used
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to have that guided me\Ntowards the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Kari, I hope your light\Ndoesn't run out of batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lead the way. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, Lord Mugendramon,\Nit's actually a pretty funny story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop stalling and tell me\Nwhat happened, Waru Monzaemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, while you are still able to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, your metalness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I found the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were in your area?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I was going to\Ncapture them for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too, but this one little\Ngirl was really strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then the new one were biting\Nme, and it was really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.89,0:10:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you thought that puny little girl was\Ntough, wait till I get through with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:11:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you alert me,\Nyou stupid carnival prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to tell you\Nsooner, but they wounded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at my owies and boo-boos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be more sympathetic\Nafter your grueling battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me reward you for helping\Nme locate the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shot my paw!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.03,0:11:20.95,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,1000)}Note: The kanji says "Waru" which means "Evil."{onkei: To put in or not to put in}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, what are you doing\Nlaying down at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Tai, that's the\Nfifth time he's collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy, but I think maybe\Nwe should rest for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let our Digimon die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a figure of speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty tired too, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we can commence our search again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't provoke him, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand? Kari's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that, Tai, but\Nshe's not here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better stop giving us orders or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or else what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't plan anything after or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought it sounded tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to see tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, did you hear that? Huh? Just\Nlisten. Getting closer. Footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I hear is my head pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he's been following us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's pretend to keep fighting\Nand we'll hide behind that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but just make sure your\Nnext punch is pretend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better stop calling me names!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bully and a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a ruffian!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the best you could come up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, on such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it could be one\Nof Machinedramund's guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaboom! Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm big and I'm big and I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, your Digivolve was a digi-dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your energy levels are too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:13:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know your original\Nintention wasn't to punch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were worried about Kari, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's fair is fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to hit me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't resort to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can be settled with violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna hit you, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I hit you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind to swipe myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.39,0:14:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.26,0:14:36.22,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Andromon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.26,0:14:36.22,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.26,0:14:36.22,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.26,0:14:36.22,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.26,0:14:36.22,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attacks
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.26,0:14:36.22,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Spiral Sword\NGatling Missile
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We met Andromon on File Island He was the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,android Digimon who had\Na black gear stuck in his
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mechanism But we removed\Nit and freed him of its
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,evil spell I wasn't sure\Nif it was you or not Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's nice to see a\Nfriendly face Even if it is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made of metal What are you\Ndoing down here anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why are you sneaking up on people?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to put together a\Nresistance army against Machinedramon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors that Digimon\Nare hiding in the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fled here when\NMachinedramon burned the cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come to the sewers to organize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while I'm here, I'm\Ngoing to fix that drip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were spies sent here\Nby Machinedramon to destroy my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How insulting. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're looking for my\Nlittle sister named Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.49,0:15:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, Biyomon, T.K., and Patamon\Nare probably with her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Queen Kari is your sister? Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari and the others are coming\Nhere? When? Now! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious, Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what I was looking for. Victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Andromon. Babysitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy you fast\Nwhile the others watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hold him up. You hide. Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Tai? When? Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Machine pod!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, it's you! Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that Andromon I saw\Nfighting with Machinedramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sacrificing himself\Nto protect us. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's raising an army\Nagainst Machinedramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragonfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Andromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take you to safety. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's fight Machinedramon together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Machinedramon's a Mega Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've got you, Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.66,0:17:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who wants to be the first victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How brave you are to volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to make this as painful as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you are doing, Numemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you slimy Digimon call this fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numemon? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, more Pidgey Bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pidgey Bombs, Digital Monsters,\NPidgey Bombs are the jumpers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pidgey Bombs, Digital Monsters,\NPidgey Bombs are the jumpers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warp, Pidgey Bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chosen Ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digital monsters! Digimon! Grr!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coralmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I will finish you once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You missed what I did as Wargreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sliced you like an onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without Machinedramon, this\Narea has become unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beginning to fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can happen to us that\Nwe can't handle together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's becoming\Na little too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.22,0:20:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Airdramon City is dissolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My work here is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Andromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we get down, can I build one of those\Nmemorials to my friends, the Numemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll all help build it, right guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're next, Piemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hatsha
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ima gozo tobi tatu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.34,0:21:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,youuki wo momete Kokoro
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.64,0:22:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No hame kirogete. Mada\Nmi nu mirai e. Ima kara.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.58,0:22:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ho kate shinai sora he mukate. Mada haji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.90,0:22:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mata bakari sa Yume e.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No Voppukane. La la la…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.92,0:22:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la…
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.10,0:22:58.06,Sign,,0,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}A Woman's Fight! LadyDevimon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the women's war, LadyDevimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.30,0:23:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the adventure has evolved.

